    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "NORTHWEST\nOrient\nAIRLINES\n½ FARE\nFOR YOUR FAMILY\nMONDAYS\nTUESDAYS\nWEDNESDAYS\nMAY 6, 1949",
      "ALASKA\nINCHORAGE\n- TO THE ORIENT\nNORTHWEST AIRLINES\nTO\nHAWAII\nDETROIT\nMILWAUKEE\nEAU\nSUPERIOR\nGRAND FORKS\nWINNIPEG\nCANADA\nGREAT FALLS\nSPOKANE\nWENATCHEE\nTACO MA\n- SEATTLE-\nCHICAGO\n- LA CROSSE\nMADISON\nROCHESTER\nST. PAUL\nFARGO\nJAMESTOWN\nABERDEEN\nBISMARCK\nMINNEAPOLIS\nMILES CITY-\nBILLINGS\nBOZEMAN\nBUTTE\nHELENA\nMISSOULA\nSTATES\nYAKIMA\nPORTLAND\nUNITED\nCLEVELAND\nPITTSBURGH\nWASHINGTON\nHONOLULU\nSEATTLE-TACOMA PORTLAND • • •\n• HONOLULU\nWESTBOUND\nEASTBOUND\nOne Way\n$160\nRound Trip\n$288\n(PLUS TAX)\n701\nTU. TH.\nSA.\nSeattle.... (PST) Lv. 11:00 p.m.\nPortland...\n.Ar. 12:00 a.m.\nPortland\n..Lv. 12:45 a.m.\nHonolulu. ...(HST) Ar. 12:05 p.m.\nWED. FRI. SUN.\n702\nWE.\nFR. SU.\nHonolulu.... (HST) Lv. 9:30 p.m.\nPortland..... (PST) Ar. 12:15 p.m.\nPortland....\n...Lv. 12:30 p.m.\nSeattle...\n.Ar. 1:30 p.m.\nTH. SA. MO"
    ],
